  "body": "I've realized that all the `arrayBuffer` I receive from `readValue` are always wrapped around a `DataView` and I was wondering if we could simply return a `DataView` instead of an `ArrayBuffer` then.\n\nInstead of \n\n``` js\ncharacteristic.readValue().then(buffer => {\n  let data = new DataView(buffer);\n  let foo = data.getUint8(0);\n  ...\n```\n\nWe would have something simpler like\n\n``` js\ncharacteristic.readValue().then(data => {\n  let foo = data.getUint8(0);\n  // We can always access ArrayBuffer if we need to with data.buffer\n  ...\n```\n",
